      en: ["Carnot was officially established as a French post in 1894.", "The town is located approximately 300 kilometers west of the capital, Bangui.", "The gold deposits in the Carnot region are considered among the purest in the country.", "In the 1970s, Carnot experienced a second mining boom due to diamonds.", "The town is connected to Berbérati via the RN3 national highway.", "The Mambéré River has historically been a vital water source for gold panning."],
