      en: ["Obo is located over 1,200 kilometers away from the capital, Bangui.", "The town is considered the geographic center of Africa (pole of inaccessibility).", "Obo is the primary center of Zande culture in the Central African Republic.", "In 1912, Obo became part of the French territory of Oubangui-Chari.", "The town features an airstrip that is essential for supplying the remote region.", "The Mbomou River forms the natural border with the DR Congo south of Obo."],
